        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "队友"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That server answered with HTTP %lld — it doesn't look like a TeamClu Cloud API.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该服务器返回了 HTTP %lld——看起来不是 TeamClu Cloud API。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The TeamClu Cloud API this app talks to. Everything else — including the message broker — is discovered from it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 连接的 TeamClu Cloud API。其余一切（包括消息代理）都由它下发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The agent's Supabase identity, daemon credentials, and member authorizations will be deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该 Agent 的账号身份、daemon 凭证与成员授权都将被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The idea will reappear in the main list.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该想法会重新出现在主列表。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The message is removed for everyone in this session.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "消息将对会话中的所有人删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These tools run without a prompt. Real persistence will land alongside the per-agent permission spec.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些工具运行时不再询问。真实的持久化将随每 Agent 权限规范一起上线。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They will lose access to all of this team's ideas and sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对方将失去该团队所有想法与会话的访问权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
